Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 18:24:17 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] ci: delete three workflows that can only fail
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

benchmark.yml — weekly cron ran tools/benchmark.js, deleted in #87;
every scheduled run has been failing (the path trigger also can never
fire: assets/js/vr-*.js no longer exists).
wasm-build.yml — builds wasm/** which has never existed; triggers are
all path-filtered to deleted dirs so it only fires via dispatch.
v5.8.0-planning.yml — weekly cron audits module paths that no longer
exist; every run fails on its first grep.

Co-Authored-By: うめ <app.shizukutanaka@gmail.com>
